  2	//!
  3	//! Implements kernel.xml emission and Vivado package generation. The
  4	//! kernel.xml emission is delegated to `platform::kernel_xml::emit_kernel_xml`
  5	//! and Vivado execution to `run_vivado`. Archive redaction for reproducible
  6	//! builds lives in the [`redact`] submodule.
